{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114123305167-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114134037\"/><p>牛頭角發生交通意外。今午(14日)12時17分，一輛客貨車沿通明街行駛，至準備右轉入牛頭角道一行人過路處時，撞倒一名老婦，事主受傷當場陷入昏迷。救護車接報到場將老婦送院救治，涉事司機在場助查肇事原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.653303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:33:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:42.600892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:58.645956+00:00","content_hash":"87880a6057ef7277f3817da1ca273a7427de80dc68c76996c74cc5bb114980ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}